	"data": "Gargoyle Sensor Research — Atmospheric EM & Full-Spectrum RF\n\nCreated: 2025-08-25\nPurpose: Hardware survey for a wearable gargoyle-style computing module that can SEE and VISUALIZE both atmospheric electromagnetic phenomena and the full RF signal spectrum.\n\nDOMAIN 1: Atmospheric Electromagnetic Sensors\n\nVLF/ELF Reception (3 Hz – 30 kHz)\n\nWhat lives in this band:\nSchumann resonances — fundamental at 7.83 Hz, harmonics at 14.07, 20.25, 26.41, 32.45 Hz. The Earth-ionosphere cavity resonates like a…",
